exports[`receipts beyond the four > as a pull request's Markdown, bound to its commit, with the receipt fenced so nothing in it renders 1`] = `
"## Tesota receipt

Commit \`6734e933830e\`, changes from \`700f9a9d4a0b\`; Tesota 0.1.0-alpha.1, model \`openai/gpt-6.1-sol\`; session \`session-584\`, 2026-10-22T22:13:49.609Z to 2026-10-22T22:50:14.441Z.

The receipt records observed differences. Its attribution limits and measurements are stated below; comparisons keep the request's admission base.

\`\`\`text
Tesota receipt
2 review flags · 7 verification limits
Evidence, not approval: accepting the change is yours.

✓ Tested   bun run check · 5:58
○ Proved   none recorded
○ Models   none recorded

! Review test edits · 2 heuristic flags
  May weaken evidence; not confirmed weakening.
○ Change sensitivity unknown · 3 test files
  Base fails too; no per-test failure report.
○ Attribution unresolved
  history moved, could not be read, or was not captured; recorded exercise and contract measurements do not establish request attribution. Changes are compared with the request's start, not attributed to this request
○ No proof covers 3 changed files

Details
  passed        bun run check
  not checked   packages/core/tests/interface.test.ts: on the base it failed, but so does the base without it, and no test report says which tests fail; contribution unresolved
  not checked   tests/welcome-header.test.ts: on the base it failed, but so does the base without it, and no test report says which tests fail; contribution unresolved
  not checked   tests/working-orb.test.ts: on the base it failed, but so does the base without it, and no test report says which tests fail; contribution unresolved
  may weaken    packages/core/tests/interface.test.ts: edits a test file
  may weaken    tests/welcome-header.test.ts: edits a test file
  not proved    NOTICE: no proof covers it; the project's commands pass with it
  not proved    src/tesota.ts: no proof covers it; the project's commands pass with it
  not proved    src/welcome-header.ts: no proof covers it; the project's commands pass with it
  changed lines implementation +99 -18 · tests +75 -25 · other +7 -0
  model listed  no case the request leaves open, by openai/gpt-6-sol; a model's opinion, not a check
From 700f9a9d4a0b · Tesota 0.1.0-alpha.1 · openai/gpt-6.1-sol

Request clarification (operator input, not evidence or acceptance)
Agent question: Issue #584 requires real-terminal dark/light screenshots or a recording in the PR. Can you provide that visual evidence? I can run automated terminal tests here, but cannot inspect a real terminal window.
Operator selected: Open PR with gap noted — Open the PR with real-terminal visual acceptance explicitly pending.

Subagents (each one's receipt covers its own branch, not this change)
- Review orb acceptance and wiring: completed, read only · openai/gpt-5.6-sol
\`\`\`

This is check evidence, not a reviewer's acceptance."
`;

